## Project Overview: Steacher

**Steacher** is a web-based educational platform for interactive exercises and AI-assisted learning. It uses a Django backend with PostgreSQL, a modern TypeScript + Vue 3 multi-page frontend, and integrates LLMs (OpenAI and Gemini) to guide learners through a Socratic approach.

## Key Files and Directories

- **Backend (Django)**
  - `exam_project/settings.py`: Project [settings](mdc:exam_project/settings.py) (Django 5, CORS, DRF, Argon2, email, logging, security).
  - `exercises/models.py`: [Domain models](mdc:exercises/models.py) (courses, modules, exercises, attempts, traces, memberships, cohorts, assets, invites, chat threads, evals).
  - `exercises/logic.py`: [Core logic](mdc:exercises/logic.py) and LLM orchestration.
